---
description: When the user asks about past agent work, spend, or "what did we do", query the OpenBurnBar MCP instead of guessing.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks about past agent work, spend, burn, or "what did we do",
query the OpenBurnBar MCP for session history and spend evidence:

1. Call `burnbar_resolve_capabilities` first and read the returned tool list.
2. Call `burnbar_search_conversations` for session history and
   `burnbar_recent_usage` for spend metadata.
3. Quote titles, snippets, and usage numbers from tool results as evidence.
4. Name any field still sealed ciphertext instead of inventing its contents.
